  // ============================================================
  //  OVERVIEW MAP PIN PICKER — "Marker is accurate"
  // ============================================================
  // When the planner ticks "Marker is accurate" we reveal a small Leaflet
  // map with a draggable pin so they can place the exact site. The pin is
  // seeded from the booking's saved lat/lng, else geocoded from the typed
